<section id="scan-status" aria-label="Analysis status">
<h2>{% if scan_status.has_failures %}Partial analysis{% elif scan_status.outer_complete is none %}Analysis status unavailable{% else %}Analysis coverage{% endif %}</h2>
<p>Scan execution: {% if scan_status.outer_complete is none %}completion not recorded{% elif scan_status.outer_complete %}finished{% else %}incomplete{% endif %}.
Execution completion does not establish usable labels or their correctness.
Status below covers the whole stored scan, including any epochs outside this report.</p>
{% if scan_status.has_failures %}<p>Some requested analysis failed or has missing coverage. Empty or omitted sections must not be interpreted as an absence of activity.</p>{% endif %}
{% for s in scan_status.scanners %}
<details class="event"{% if s.has_failures %} open="open"{% endif %}>
<summary>{{ s.scanner }}{% if s.has_failures %}: incomplete or failed results{% endif %}{% if not s.mounted %}: not mounted in this report{% endif %}</summary>
<p>Recorded scanner executions: {{ s.scanned_transcripts }}{% if s.expected_transcripts is not none %} of {{ s.expected_transcripts }} expected transcripts{% else %}; expected transcript count unknown{% endif %}.
Recorded execution errors: {{ s.execution_errors }}.
{% if s.missing_transcripts is not none %}Missing executions: {{ s.missing_transcripts }}.{% endif %}</p>
{% if s.observed_units is not none %}
<p>Recorded {{ s.unit }}: {{ s.observed_units }}; usable direct labels: {{ s.usable_units }};
failed: {{ s.failed_units }}; refused: {{ s.refused_units }}; unanswered or missing: {{ s.missing_units }}.
{% if s.filled_units or s.attributed_units %}Filled labels: {{ s.filled_units }}; attributed turns: {{ s.attributed_units }}. These are not directly judged labels.{% endif %}</p>
{% else %}<p>Usable label coverage is not assessed for this scanner's stored content.</p>{% endif %}
{% if s.coverage_errors %}<p>Unusable coverage records: {{ s.coverage_errors }}.</p>{% endif %}
{% if s.degraded_judgements %}<p>Member or verifier judgements without a usable answer: {{ s.degraded_judgements }}. These can coexist with usable final labels and are not a count of distinct provider calls.</p>{% endif %}
{% for note in s.notes %}<p>{{ note }}</p>{% endfor %}
</details>
{% endfor %}
{% if scan_status.errors %}
<details class="event" open="open"><summary>Recorded analysis errors</summary>
{% for error in scan_status.errors %}<p>{{ error.scanner }}{% if error.transcript_id %} · transcript {{ error.transcript_id }}{% endif %}: {{ error.message }}</p>{% endfor %}
</details>
{% endif %}
</section>
